{
  "$schema": "../gen/schemas/desktop-schema.json",
  "identifier": "default",
  "description": "主窗口默认权限：应用核心命令、文件夹选择、在文件管理器中显示，以及「用系统默认程序打开用户选定的路径」",
  "windows": ["main"],
  "permissions": [
    "core:default",
    "core:window:allow-start-dragging",
    "core:window:allow-close",
    "core:window:allow-minimize",
    "core:window:allow-set-fullscreen",
    "dialog:default",
    "opener:default",
    {
      "identifier": "opener:allow-open-path",
      "comment": "open_path 不在 opener:default 里（默认只含 open_url / reveal_item_in_dir）。缺了它，「PDF 打印视图」与「设置 → 工作区目录 → 打开」会报 ACL 错误（真机验收发现）。这里只放行**用户自己选定过的位置**：家目录、临时目录、外接卷——应用不会把笔记内容里的字符串当路径传进来。",
      "allow": [
        { "path": "$HOME/**" },
        { "path": "$TEMP/**" },
        { "path": "$APPDATA/**" },
        { "path": "$APPLOCALDATA/**" },
        { "path": "/Volumes/**" },
        { "path": "/tmp/**" },
        { "path": "/private/tmp/**" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
